        "body": {
          "en": "\\( f(x) \\) gives the output for an input \\( x \\). The composite \\( fg(x)=f(g(x)) \\) is applied inside-out; the inverse \\( f^{-1} \\) reverses \\( f \\).",
          "ar": null
        }
